%N A375467 Triangle read by rows: number of unlabeled rooted trees with n vertices where the level of a vertex is bounded by k.
%C A375467 The level of a vertex is the number of vertices in the path from the root to the vertex, the level of the root is 1.
%H A375467 Peter Luschny, <a href="/A375467/b375467.txt">Rows n = 0..140, flattened</a>.
%H A375467 Peter Luschny, <a href="/A375467/a375467.txt">Python implementation</a>.
%F A375467 The rows accumulate the rows of A034781.
%F A375467 T(n, k) = (1/(n-1)) * Sum_{j=1..n-1} T(j, k) * H(n-j, k-1) for n >= 2 and k > 1, where H(n, k) = Sum_{d|n} d*T(d, k). T(n, 0) = 0 and T(1, k) = 1 for k >= 1. - _Peter Luschny_, Aug 19 2026
