%e A375467 This is a modified form of the list given by _Joerg Arndt_ in A000081, illustrating the successive construction of row 6 in the table: at each step, the maximal permissible value of a component is increased by 1. Then T(n, k) is the number of parenthesis tuples whose largest component does not exceed k.
